-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Exception: images derived from the Google Fonts Knowledge figures
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above does NOT cover the following files. They are rendered
from, cut out of, or contain the figures of Google Fonts Knowledge, "Type
classification in CJK" (Chinese, Japanese and Korean lessons),
https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/type_in_china_japan_and_korea,
and are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ :

  research/figs/*                 the lessons' figures, rendered to PNG
  research/figure_lines/*         text lines cut from those figures
  research/figure_lines_sheet.png contact sheet of those lines
  research/cn_all.png             the Chinese figures stacked
  research/jp_all.png             the Japanese figures stacked
  research/kr_all.png             the Korean figures stacked
  docs/figures_zh.png             those lines with this model's predictions
  docs/figures_ja.png             (the prediction text is added by this project;
  docs/figures_ko.png              the images as a whole remain CC BY-SA 4.0)

Attribution: Google Fonts Knowledge, "Type classification in CJK", CC BY-SA 4.0.
Changes: figures rasterised to PNG, single text lines cropped, predictions drawn.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fonts
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Fonts are not included. scripts/fetch_fonts.py downloads them with their own
licences (OFL, Apache, IPA, Arphic, GPL and others; see fonts/SOURCES.md). The
model files in models/ were trained on renders of those fonts.
